cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use INOOR, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "INOOR: Iranian National Observatory Optical Reduction"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-02
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/hosseintd/INOOR"
abstract: >-
  INOOR is a GUI-based application for reducing images from the 3.4 m telescope
  of the Iranian National Observatory (INO340) without writing code. It takes raw
  frames to calibrated, cleaned frames, then makes scientific measurements on them,
  such as astrometry, aperture photometry, light curves and extinction coefficients,
  and looks up sources in the Pan-STARRS1 catalog for comparison.
keywords:
  - astronomy software
  - data reduction
  - calibration
  - photometry
  - light curves
  - astrometry
  - INO340
